# Curse of the Werefox: the reflexive ability triggers "when you do" create a Monster Role token attached to the creature (CR 603.12),
# and a Role that could not enchant it is not created (CR 303.4i). Bot1 casts the Curse on its Grizzly Bears and, in response, has
# Giver of Runes give the Bears protection from colorless: no Role is created, so Bot1 is never asked what the Bears fight (the
# bare refusal) and Bot2's Hill Giant takes no damage, and the Bears stay 2/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Grizzly Bears
Curse of the Werefox
Giver of Runes
Island
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mountain
Hill Giant
Mountain x2
Mountain x14

