Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Curse of the Werefox.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Battlefield.Giver of Runes.Activate(Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Target
Bot1.Pass
